      "text": "Day 5 · Breakfast and transfer to the airport for your flight to Balmaceda. On arrival, meet your local English-speaking driver-guide. The journey begins along the legendary Carretera Austral, heading south through the wide-open Patagonian steppe and the vast valleys of the Aysén region. Little by little, arid plains give way to forested slopes, until the road reveals the brilliant turquoise waters of Lago General Carrera. Arrival in Puerto Río Tranquilo and overnight at El Puesto Patagonia.",
